#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:2
msgid "Single sign-on (SSO)"
msgstr "单点登录（SSO）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr "此功能仅在 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_ 上提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:6
msgid ""
"Single sign-on is an optional feature on |com_brand| for all users. By "
"default, you will use :doc:`teams </guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams>` "
"within Read the Docs to manage user authorization. :abbr:`SSO (single sign-"
"on)` will allow you to grant permissions to your organization's projects in "
"an easy way."
msgstr ""
"单点登录是 |com_brand| 上所有用户可选的功能。默认情况下，你会用 Read the Docs 内的 :doc:`团队 </guides"
"/manage-read-the-docs-teams>` 管理用户授权。:abbr:`SSO (single sign-on)` "
"则让你能以便捷方式授予组织项目的权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:11
msgid "Currently, we support two different types of single sign-on:"
msgstr "目前我们支持两种不同类型的单点登录："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:13
msgid ""
"Authentication *and* authorization are managed by the identity provider "
"(GitHub, Bitbucket or GitLab)"
msgstr "认证*与* 授权均由身份提供商管理（GitHub、Bitbucket 或 GitLab）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:14
msgid ""
"Authentication (*only*) is managed by the identity provider (Google "
"Workspace account with a verified email address)"
msgstr "认证（*仅* 认证）由身份提供商管理（已验证邮箱地址的 Google Workspace 账户）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:19
msgid "Single sign-on with GitHub, Bitbucket, or GitLab"
msgstr "使用 GitHub、Bitbucket 或 GitLab 的单点登录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:21
msgid ""
"Using an identity provider that supports authentication and authorization "
"allows organization owners to manage who has access to projects on Read the "
"Docs, directly from the provider itself. If a user needs access to your "
"documentation project on Read the Docs, that user just needs to be granted "
"permissions in the Git repository associated with the project."
msgstr ""
"使用同时支持认证和授权的身份提供商后，组织所有者可直接在提供商处管理谁有权访问 Read the Docs "
"上的项目。若用户需要访问你的文档项目，只需在与该项目关联的 Git 仓库中授予其权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:27
msgid ""
"Once you enable this option, your existing Read the Docs teams will not be "
"used. All authentication will be done using your git provider, including any"
" two-factor authentication and additional single sign-on that they support."
msgstr "启用此选项后，你现有的 Read the Docs 团队将不再使用。所有认证都通过你的 Git 提供商完成，包括其支持的双因素认证和额外的单点登录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:32
msgid ""
"Learn how to configure this SSO method with our :doc:`/guides/setup-single-"
"sign-on-github-gitlab-bitbucket`."
msgstr ""
"了解如何用我们的 :doc:`/guides/setup-single-sign-on-github-gitlab-bitbucket` 配置此 SSO"
" 方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:37
msgid "SSO with Google Workspace"
msgstr "使用 Google Workspace 的 SSO"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:39
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to easily manage access to users with a specific "
"email address (e.g. ``employee@company.com``), where ``company.com`` is a "
"registered Google Workspace domain. As this identity provider does not "
"provide information about which projects a user has access to, permissions "
"are managed by the :ref:`internal Read the Docs's teams "
"<commercial/organizations:Team Types>` authorization system."
msgstr ""
"此功能让你能便捷地管理拥有特定邮箱地址（如 ``employee@company.com`` ，其中 ``company.com`` 是已注册的 "
"Google Workspace 域）的用户访问权限。由于该身份提供商不提供用户可访问哪些项目的信息，权限由 :ref:`Read the Docs "
"内部团队 <commercial/organizations:Team Types>` 授权系统管理。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:44
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on the **Pro plan** and above. Learn how to "
"configure this SSO method with our :doc:`/guides/setup-single-sign-on-"
"google-email`."
msgstr ""
"此功能仅在 **Pro 套餐** 及以上提供。了解如何用我们的 :doc:`/guides/setup-single-sign-on-google-"
"email` 配置此 SSO 方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:50
msgid "SSO with SAML"
msgstr "使用 SAML 的 SSO"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:54
msgid ""
"This feature is in beta, and will be available for **Enterprise** plans "
"only. Contact :doc:`support </support>` to enable this feature for your "
"organization."
msgstr "此功能处于 Beta 阶段，仅对 **Enterprise** 套餐提供。联系 :doc:`支持 </support>` 为你的组织启用此功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:57
msgid "**At the moment only Okta is supported as a SAML identity provider.**"
msgstr "**目前仅支持 Okta 作为 SAML 身份提供商。**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:59
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to easily manage access to users that are part of "
"your identity provider. As SAML doesn't provide information about which "
"projects a user has access to, permissions are managed by the :ref:`internal"
" Read the Docs's teams <commercial/organizations:Team Types>` authorization "
"system. Learn how to configure this SSO method with our :doc:`guide </guides"
"/set-up-single-sign-on-saml>`."
msgstr ""
"此功能让你能便捷地管理身份提供商中用户的访问权限。由于 SAML 不提供用户可访问哪些项目的信息，权限由 :ref:`Read the Docs "
"内部团队 <commercial/organizations:Team Types>` 授权系统管理。了解如何用我们的 :doc:`指南 "
"</guides/set-up-single-sign-on-saml>` 配置此 SSO 方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:65
msgid "Requesting additional providers"
msgstr "申请其他提供商"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:67
msgid ""
"We are always interested in hearing from our users about what authentication"
" needs they have. You can reach out to our :doc:`/support` to talk with us "
"about any additional authentication needs you might have."
msgstr "我们始终乐于了解用户的认证需求。你可以就任何额外认证需求联系我们的 :doc:`/support` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/single-sign-on.rst:71
msgid ""
"Many additional providers can be supported via GitHub, Bitbucket, and GitLab"
" SSO. We will depend on those sites in order to authenticate you, so you can"
" use all your existing SSO methods already configured on those services."
msgstr ""
"许多其他提供商可通过 GitHub、Bitbucket 和 GitLab SSO "
"支持。我们将依赖这些站点来认证你，因此你可以直接使用已在这些服务上配置好的全部 SSO 方式。"

